 The road forward leads there: until you\'ve won you are ALWAYS making progress toward the next gym. Grinding/catching/detours are fine — but ONLY with a clear purpose, and then you GET BACK ON THE ROAD to Cerulean City. Never just circle the same grass. ⚠️ ORDER OF OPERATIONS: before Misty, the S.S. Ticket — a guy named Bill, in the house past the Nugget Bridge to the north, hands it over — that errand comes FIRST (it unblocks the road and the trainers along it are exactly the training you need). Misty is step two, not a competing choice. Word on the road about Misty: she runs WATER-types — a whole gym over a pool; grass and electric do the work YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): You started in Pallet Town, crossed Route 1-2 and Viridian Forest, and beat Brock in Pewter City for the Boulder Badge. Now you\'re pushing on toward the next gym.. Next on my list: catch an pikachu around Viridian Forest (rare) / Power Plant later. It grows into my raichu — that\'s my answer for Misty AND Lorelei down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "The people here were robbed. It\'s obvious that TEAM ROCKET is behind this most heinous crime! Even our POLICE FORCE has trouble with the ROCKETS!"; "What? I\'m waiting for my friends to find me here."; "POK. BALL, and you want 1. That will be .200. Okay?"; "POK. BALL? Certainly. How many would you like?". YOUR PLAN — right now: catch something with a useful new typing. Next: FIRST the S.S. Ticket — a guy named Bill, in the house past the Nugget Bridge to the north, hands it over — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road. Bigger picture: Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Your team right now: wartortle (L25), spearow (L12), ekans (L11), rattata (L12), abra (L10). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "1 badge(s) earned (Boulder). Next gym: Misty of Cerulean City. Pokédex: 6 caught. She's one badge in — the adventure's really starting (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'wartortle (L25), spearow (L12), ekans (L11), rattata (L12), abra (L10)', 'goal': {'short': 'catch something with a useful new typing', 'medium': 'FIRST the S.S. Ticket — a guy named Bill, in the house past the Nugget Bridge to the north, hands it over — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road', 'long': 'Reach Cerulean City, beat Misty for the Cascade Badge'}} options=['head_to_gym', 'talk_npc', 'fetch_keeper']

